    "enUS": {
      "description": "<Among the fishing knickknacks in the debris are some rusty hooks, broken spools of wire, and a slightly corroded but ornate silver hair clip with the monogram \"K.D.\">",
      "summary": "Return the Monogrammed Silver Hair clip to its owner.",
      "title": "Silver of the Waves",
